            "book": "626b6bd27999137613db53cb"
        },
        "chapterId": "TIT.1",
        "content": "na ɛberɛ a ɛsɛ mu no, ɔdaa asɛm no a daa yɛka ho asɛm no adi. Onyankopɔn a ɔyɛ yɛn Agyenkwa na wafrɛ me sɛ menyɛ adwuma a ɔde ahyɛ me nsa yi.",
        "reference": "Tito 1:3",
        "verseNumber": "3",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590bf531092a820c46a3f",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "TIT.1.4",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "TIT",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd27999137613db541a",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "TIT",
            "id": "TIT.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd27999137613db53cb"
        },
        "chapterId": "TIT.1",
        "content": "Meretwerɛ akɔma me ba Tito afa gyidie baako a yɛn nyinaa kura mu no ho:\n    \n    Adom ne asomdwoeɛ a ɛfiri Agya Onyankopɔn ne Kristo Yesu, yɛn Agyenkwa no nka wo!",
        "reference": "Tito 1:4",
        "verseNumber": "4",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590bf531092a820c46a6f",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "TIT.1.5",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "TIT",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd27999137613db541a",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "TIT",
            "id": "TIT.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd27999137613db53cb"
        },
        "chapterId": "TIT.1",
        "content": "Megyaa wo Kreta sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a wobɛtoto nneɛma a aka no pɛpɛɛpɛ na wayi mpanimfoɔ atuatua asafo a ɛwɔ kuro biara mu no ano.",
        "reference": "Tito 1:5",
        "verseNumber": "5",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590bf531092a820c46ac0",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "TIT.1.6",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "TIT",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd27999137613db541a",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "TIT",
            "id": "TIT.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd27999137613db53cb"
        },
        "chapterId": "TIT.1",
        "content": "Kae mmara a mehyɛ maa wo no. Ɔpanin yɛ obi a ne ho nni asɛm na ɔwɔ yere baako na ne mma yɛ agyidifoɔ a wɔmmɔ ahohwi bra, na wɔnyɛ asoɔden nso.",
        "reference": "Tito 1:6",
        "verseNumber": "6",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590bf531092a820c46b11",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "TIT.1.7",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "TIT",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd27999137613db541a",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "TIT",
            "id": "TIT.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd27999137613db53cb"
        },
        "chapterId": "TIT.1",
        "content": "Ɛnsɛ sɛ mfomsoɔ biara ba ɔpanin no ho ɛfiri sɛ, Onyame adwuma hyɛ ne nsa. Ɛnsɛ sɛ ɔyɛ ahomasoɔ, anaa obi a ne bo nkyɛre fu anaa ɔkɔwensani anaa basabasayɛfoɔ anaa sikanibereɛfoɔ.",
        "reference": "Tito 1:7",
        "verseNumber": "7",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590bf531092a820c46b4c",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "TIT.1.8",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "TIT",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd27999137613db541a",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "TIT",
            "id": "TIT.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd27999137613db53cb"
        },
        "chapterId": "TIT.1",
        "content": "Ɛsɛ sɛ ɔyɛ obi a ɔpɛ ahɔhoyɛ na nʼani gye deɛ ɛyɛ ho na nʼadwenem da hɔ na ɔtene na ɔyɛ kronn na ɔwɔ ahohyɛsoɔ.",
        "reference": "Tito 1:8",
        "verseNumber": "8",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590bf531092a820c46bb1",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "TIT.1.9",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "TIT",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd27999137613db541a",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "TIT",
            "id": "TIT.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd27999137613db53cb"
        },
        "chapterId": "TIT.1",
        "content": "Ɛsɛ sɛ ɔsɔ asɛm no mu denden sɛdeɛ wɔkyerɛɛ no no. Sɛ ɛba saa a, ɔbɛtumi ahyɛ afoforɔ den wɔ saa nkyerɛkyerɛ pa no mu, na wada wɔn a wɔtia asɛm no mu no nso mfomsoɔ adi.",
        "reference": "Tito 1:9",
        "verseNumber": "9",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590bf531092a820c46c1b",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "TIT.1.10",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "TIT",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd27999137613db541a",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "TIT",
            "id": "TIT.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd27999137613db53cb"
        },
        "chapterId": "TIT.1",
        "content": "Nnipa pii wɔ hɔ a wɔsɔre tia na wɔnam wɔn nkwaseasɛm so daadaa afoforɔ, ne titire no, wɔn a wɔfiri twetiatwasom no mu.",
        "reference": "Tito 1:10",
        "verseNumber": "10",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590bf531092a820c46c41",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "TIT.1.11",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "TIT",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd27999137613db541a",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "TIT",
            "id": "TIT.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd27999137613db53cb"
        },
        "chapterId": "TIT.1",
        "content": "Ɛsɛ sɛ wosi wɔn nkyerɛkyerɛ no ano ɛfiri sɛ, wɔnam wɔn nkyerɛkyerɛ bɔne no so ma ntoto ba mmusua mu nam so de pɛ sika.",
        "reference": "Tito 1:11",
        "verseNumber": "11",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590bf531092a820c46c8e",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "TIT.1.12",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "TIT",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd27999137613db541a",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "TIT",
            "id": "TIT.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd27999137613db53cb"
        },
        "chapterId": "TIT.1",
        "content": "Mpo Kreta adiyifoɔ no mu baako kaa sɛ, “Kretafoɔ no yɛ atorofoɔ, mmoa atirimuɔdenfoɔ ne akwadwofoɔ adidifoɔ.”",
        "reference": "Tito 1:12",
        "verseNumber": "12",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590bf531092a820c46cae",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "TIT.1.13",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "TIT",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd27999137613db541a",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "TIT",
            "id": "TIT.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd27999137613db53cb"
        },
        "chapterId": "TIT.1",
        "content": "Na asɛm a ɔkaeɛ no yɛ nokorɛ. Esiane saa enti, ɛsɛ sɛ moka wɔn anim yie sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a wɔbɛnya gyidie pa,",
        "reference": "Tito 1:13",
        "verseNumber": "13",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590c0531092a820c46cff",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "TIT.1.14",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "TIT",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd27999137613db541a",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "TIT",
            "id": "TIT.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd27999137613db53cb"
        },
        "chapterId": "TIT.1",
        "content": "na wɔantena ase amma twetiatwa atorɔsɛm ne nhyɛ a ɛfiri nnipa a wɔapo nokorɛ no.",
        "reference": "Tito 1:14",
        "verseNumber": "14",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590c0531092a820c46d5a",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "TIT.1.15",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "TIT",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd27999137613db541a",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "TIT",
            "id": "TIT.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd27999137613db53cb"
        },
        "chapterId": "TIT.1",
        "content": "Biribiara yɛ kronn ma wɔn a wɔyɛ kronn no, nanso biribiara nyɛ kronn mma wɔn a wɔn ho agu fi na wɔnni gyidie, ɛfiri sɛ, wɔn adwene ne wɔn atiboa ho agu fi.",
        "reference": "Tito 1:15",
        "verseNumber": "15",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590c0531092a820c46da6",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "TIT.1.16",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "TIT",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd27999137613db541a",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "TIT",
            "id": "TIT.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd27999137613db53cb"
        },
        "chapterId": "TIT.1",
        "content": "Wɔka sɛ wɔnim Onyankopɔn, nanso wɔn nneyɛeɛ nkyerɛ saa. Wɔyɛ nnipa a obiara tan wɔn, na wɔyɛ asoɔdenfoɔ a wɔntumi nyɛ ade pa biara.",
        "reference": "Tito 1:16",
        "verseNumber": "16",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590c0531092a820c46ef0",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "TIT.2.1",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "TIT",
        "chapter": {
