            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd27999137613db53cb"
        },
        "chapterId": "TIT.2",
        "content": "Ɛsɛ sɛ wokyerɛ nkyerɛkyerɛ pa a wagye ato mu.",
        "reference": "Tito 2:1",
        "verseNumber": "1",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590c0531092a820c46eff",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "TIT.2.2",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "TIT",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd27999137613db5446",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "TIT",
            "id": "TIT.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd27999137613db53cb"
        },
        "chapterId": "TIT.2",
        "content": "Ka kyerɛ nkɔkoraa na wɔmma wɔn ani nna hɔ, wɔnyɛ anyansafoɔ, na wɔnhyɛ wɔn ho so; wɔn gyidie mu nyɛ den, wɔnnya ɔdɔ na wɔntumi ntena ɔhaw mu.",
        "reference": "Tito 2:2",
        "verseNumber": "2",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590c0531092a820c46f6c",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "TIT.2.3",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "TIT",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd27999137613db5446",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "TIT",
            "id": "TIT.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd27999137613db53cb"
        },
        "chapterId": "TIT.2",
        "content": "Saa ara nso na ka kyerɛ mmerewa na wɔmmɔ ɔbra a ɛyɛ kronn. Wɔnnni nsekuro na wɔnnyɛ asadweam nso. Wɔnkyerɛ akyerɛ pa,",
        "reference": "Tito 2:3",
        "verseNumber": "3",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590c0531092a820c46fb2",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "TIT.2.4",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "TIT",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd27999137613db5446",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "TIT",
            "id": "TIT.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd27999137613db53cb"
        },
        "chapterId": "TIT.2",
        "content": "sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a wɔnam so bɛtumi ama mmabaawa adɔ wɔn kununom ne wɔn mma,",
        "reference": "Tito 2:4",
        "verseNumber": "4",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590c0531092a820c46fe7",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "TIT.2.5",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "TIT",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd27999137613db5446",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "TIT",
            "id": "TIT.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd27999137613db53cb"
        },
        "chapterId": "TIT.2",
        "content": "ama wɔatumi ahyɛ wɔn ho so, ayɛ kronn na wɔayɛ awarefoɔ pa a wɔtie wɔn kununom asɛm, na obi anka bɔne amfa Onyankopɔn asɛm no ho.",
        "reference": "Tito 2:5",
        "verseNumber": "5",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590c0531092a820c47024",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "TIT.2.6",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "TIT",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd27999137613db5446",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "TIT",
            "id": "TIT.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd27999137613db53cb"
        },
        "chapterId": "TIT.2",
        "content": "Saa ara na hyɛ mmeranteɛ na wɔnnya ahohyɛsoɔ.",
        "reference": "Tito 2:6",
        "verseNumber": "6",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
