        },
        "chapterId": "TIT.2",
        "content": "Nneɛma nyinaa mu, fa wo ho yɛ nhwɛsoɔ pa wɔ nnwuma payɛ mu. Di nokorɛ na ma wʼani nku wo nkyerɛkyerɛ ho.",
        "reference": "Tito 2:7",
        "verseNumber": "7",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590c1531092a820c470b1",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "TIT.2.8",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "TIT",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd27999137613db5446",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "TIT",
            "id": "TIT.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd27999137613db53cb"
        },
        "chapterId": "TIT.2",
        "content": "Ka nsɛm a ɛho te na obi antumi antia mu na ama atamfoɔ ani awu sɛ wɔnnya asɛm bɔne nka mfa yɛn ho.",
        "reference": "Tito 2:8",
        "verseNumber": "8",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590c1531092a820c470eb",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "TIT.2.9",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "TIT",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd27999137613db5446",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "TIT",
            "id": "TIT.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd27999137613db53cb"
        },
        "chapterId": "TIT.2",
        "content": "Ɛsɛ sɛ asomfoɔ tie wɔn wuranom na adeɛ nyinaa mu, wɔsɔ wɔn wuranom ani. Ɛnsɛ sɛ wɔyiyi nsɛm ano",
        "reference": "Tito 2:9",
        "verseNumber": "9",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590c1531092a820c4714a",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "TIT.2.10",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "TIT",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd27999137613db5446",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "TIT",
            "id": "TIT.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd27999137613db53cb"
        },
        "chapterId": "TIT.2",
        "content": "anaa wɔbɔ wɔn korɔno. Deɛ ɛsɛ sɛ wɔyɛ ne sɛ, ɛberɛ nyinaa mu, wɔyɛ papa na wɔdi nokorɛ na ɛnam so ma biribiara a wɔyɛ no de animuonyamhyɛ aba nkyerɛkyerɛ a ɛfa Onyankopɔn a ɔyɛ yɛn Agyenkwa no ho.",
        "reference": "Tito 2:10",
        "verseNumber": "10",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590c1531092a820c4715f",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "TIT.2.11",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "TIT",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd27999137613db5446",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "TIT",
            "id": "TIT.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd27999137613db53cb"
        },
        "chapterId": "TIT.2",
        "content": "Onyankopɔn adom a ɛde nkwagyeɛ ba no ayi no ho adi akyerɛ nnipa nyinaa.",
        "reference": "Tito 2:11",
        "verseNumber": "11",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590c1531092a820c471e1",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "TIT.2.12",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "TIT",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd27999137613db5446",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "TIT",
            "id": "TIT.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd27999137613db53cb"
        },
        "chapterId": "TIT.2",
        "content": "Na adom no kyerɛ yɛn sɛ, yɛmpa asetena a ɛho nteɛ no ne ewiase akɔnnɔ akyi na yɛntena ase ahohyɛsoɔ, kronnyɛ ne Onyamesuro mu wɔ ewiase ha.",
        "reference": "Tito 2:12",
        "verseNumber": "12",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590c1531092a820c47239",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "TIT.2.13",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "TIT",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd27999137613db5446",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "TIT",
            "id": "TIT.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd27999137613db53cb"
        },
        "chapterId": "TIT.2",
        "content": "Yɛwɔ anidasoɔ wɔ ɛberɛ a yɛretwɛn Onyankopɔn tumfoɔ a ɔne Agyenkwa Yesu Kristo no ba a ɔbɛba bio wɔ animuonyam mu no.",
        "reference": "Tito 2:13",
        "verseNumber": "13",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590c1531092a820c4726d",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "TIT.2.14",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "TIT",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd27999137613db5446",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "TIT",
            "id": "TIT.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd27999137613db53cb"
        },
        "chapterId": "TIT.2",
        "content": "Ɔde ne ho maa yɛn de gyee yɛn firii bɔne mu, ɔyɛɛ yɛn kronn de yɛn yɛɛ ne nko ara dea; nnipa a yɛpɛ papayɛ.",
        "reference": "Tito 2:14",
        "verseNumber": "14",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590c1531092a820c472b4",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "TIT.2.15",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "TIT",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd27999137613db5446",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "TIT",
            "id": "TIT.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd27999137613db53cb"
        },
        "chapterId": "TIT.2",
        "content": "Kyerɛkyerɛ saa nneɛma yi na gyina wo tumi so hyɛ wʼatiefoɔ nkuran, ka wɔn anim. Mma wɔn mu bi mmu wo abomfiaa.",
        "reference": "Tito 2:15",
        "verseNumber": "15",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590c1531092a820c473f8",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "TIT.3.1",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "TIT",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd27999137613db5499",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "TIT",
            "id": "TIT.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd27999137613db53cb"
        },
        "chapterId": "TIT.3",
        "content": "Kae wo nkurɔfoɔ na wɔmmrɛ wɔn ho ase nhyɛ mpaninnie ne tumi ase na wɔntie wɔn na wɔnsiesie wɔn ho mma nnwuma pa biara.",
        "reference": "Tito 3:1",
        "verseNumber": "1",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590c1531092a820c47460",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "TIT.3.2",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "TIT",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd27999137613db5499",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "TIT",
            "id": "TIT.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd27999137613db53cb"
        },
        "chapterId": "TIT.3",
        "content": "Ka kyerɛ wɔn sɛ wɔnnka asɛmmɔne mfa obi ho na mmom, wɔnnwo brɛoo na daa wɔnyi ɔdɔ adi nkyerɛ nnipa nyinaa.",
        "reference": "Tito 3:2",
        "verseNumber": "2",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590c2531092a820c474a4",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "TIT.3.3",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "TIT",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd27999137613db5499",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "TIT",
            "id": "TIT.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd27999137613db53cb"
        },
        "chapterId": "TIT.3",
        "content": "Kane no, na yɛn ankasa yɛyɛ nkwaseafoɔ, asoɔdenfoɔ, ne abɔnefoɔ. Na yɛyɛ akɔnnɔ ne anigyeɛ ahodoɔ nkoa. Yɛsɛee yɛn abrabɔ wɔ bɔne ne anibereɛ ho. Afoforɔ tanee yɛn maa yɛn nso yɛtanee wɔn.",
        "reference": "Tito 3:3",
        "verseNumber": "3",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590c2531092a820c474db",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "TIT.3.4",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "TIT",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd27999137613db5499",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "TIT",
            "id": "TIT.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd27999137613db53cb"
        },
        "chapterId": "TIT.3",
        "content": "Nanso, ɛberɛ a yɛn Agyenkwa Onyankopɔn ayamyɛ ne ne dɔ daa adi no,",
        "reference": "Tito 3:4",
        "verseNumber": "4",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590c2531092a820c47528",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "TIT.3.5",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "TIT",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd27999137613db5499",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "TIT",
            "id": "TIT.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd27999137613db53cb"
        },
        "chapterId": "TIT.3",
        "content": "ɔgyee yɛn nkwa. Ɛnyɛ nnwuma pa bi a yɛayɛ enti, na mmom, ɔnam nʼahummɔborɔ mu ahohoro yɛn ho, agye yɛn nkwa, ama Honhom Kronkron no awo yɛn foforɔ ama yɛn nkwa foforɔ.",
        "reference": "Tito 3:5",
        "verseNumber": "5",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590c2531092a820c47562",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "TIT.3.6",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "TIT",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd27999137613db5499",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "TIT",
            "id": "TIT.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd27999137613db53cb"
        },
        "chapterId": "TIT.3",
        "content": "Onyankopɔn nam Yesu Kristo a ɔyɛ yɛn Agyenkwa no so ahwie Honhom Kronkron no agu yɛn so",
        "reference": "Tito 3:6",
        "verseNumber": "6",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590c2531092a820c475c8",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "TIT.3.7",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "TIT",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd27999137613db5499",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "TIT",
            "id": "TIT.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd27999137613db53cb"
        },
        "chapterId": "TIT.3",
        "content": "sɛdeɛ ɛbɛyɛ a, nʼadom enti, yɛbɛyɛ daa nkwa no anidasoɔ ho adedifoɔ.",
        "reference": "Tito 3:7",
        "verseNumber": "7",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590c2531092a820c47619",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "TIT.3.8",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "TIT",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd27999137613db5499",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "TIT",
            "id": "TIT.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd27999137613db53cb"
        },
        "chapterId": "TIT.3",
        "content": "Yei yɛ nokwasɛm. Mepɛ sɛ woti saa asɛm yi mu yie na ama wɔn a wɔgye Onyankopɔn di no ahunu sɛ, ɛsɛ sɛ wɔde wɔn berɛ di dwuma pa. Yeinom nyinaa yɛ, na ɛho wɔ mfasoɔ ma nnipa.",
        "reference": "Tito 3:8",
        "verseNumber": "8",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590c2531092a820c47664",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "TIT.3.9",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "TIT",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd27999137613db5499",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "TIT",
            "id": "TIT.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd27999137613db53cb"
        },
        "chapterId": "TIT.3",
        "content": "Nanso, monnnye nkwasea akyinnyeɛ. Saa ara nso na monnto ana, nkasakasa, nko wɔ mmara so. Ɛho nni mfasoɔ biara.",
        "reference": "Tito 3:9",
        "verseNumber": "9",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590c2531092a820c476a2",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "TIT.3.10",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "TIT",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd27999137613db5499",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "TIT",
            "id": "TIT.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd27999137613db53cb"
        },
        "chapterId": "TIT.3",
        "content": "Obi a ɔde mpaapaemu ba no, bɔ no kɔkɔ deɛ ɛdi ɛkan ne deɛ ɛtɔ so mmienu, na ɛno akyi no, te wo ho firi ne ho.",
        "reference": "Tito 3:10",
        "verseNumber": "10",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590c2531092a820c476d4",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "TIT.3.11",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "TIT",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd27999137613db5499",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "TIT",
            "id": "TIT.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd27999137613db53cb"
        },
        "chapterId": "TIT.3",
        "content": "Ɛsɛ sɛ wohunu sɛ obi a ɔte saa no asɛe, na bɔne a ɔyɛ no da adi wɔ ne ho.",
        "reference": "Tito 3:11",
        "verseNumber": "11",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590c2531092a820c47746",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "TIT.3.12",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "TIT",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd27999137613db5499",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "TIT",
            "id": "TIT.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd27999137613db53cb"
        },
        "chapterId": "TIT.3",
        "content": "Sɛ mesoma Artema anaa Tihiko wo nkyɛn a, bɔ mmɔden bra me nkyɛn wɔ Nikopoli, na ɛhɔ na mabɔ me tirim sɛ mɛtena awɔberɛ no.",
        "reference": "Tito 3:12",
        "verseNumber": "12",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590c2531092a820c477bb",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "TIT.3.13",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "TIT",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd27999137613db5499",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "TIT",
            "id": "TIT.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd27999137613db53cb"
        },
        "chapterId": "TIT.3",
        "content": "Bɔ mmɔden gya mmaranimfoɔ Sena ne Apolo ɛkwan yie na anhia wɔn hwee.",
        "reference": "Tito 3:13",
        "verseNumber": "13",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590c2531092a820c477fa",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "TIT.3.14",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "TIT",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd27999137613db5499",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "TIT",
            "id": "TIT.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd27999137613db53cb"
        },
        "chapterId": "TIT.3",
        "content": "Ma yɛn nkurɔfoɔ no nsua sɛdeɛ wɔde wɔn adagyeɛ yɛ nnwuma pa de boa. Ɛnsɛ sɛ wɔtena ase kwa.",
        "reference": "Tito 3:14",
        "verseNumber": "14",
        "chapterNumber": 3,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b590c2531092a820c47827",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "TIT.3.15",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "TIT",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bd27999137613db5499",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "TIT",
            "id": "TIT.3",
            "number": "3",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bd27999137613db53cb"
        },
        "chapterId": "TIT.3",
        "content": "Wɔn a wɔne me wɔ ha nyinaa kyeakyea wo.\n    Kyea wɔn a wɔdɔ yɛn wɔ gyidie mu ma yɛn.\n    \n    Adom nka mo nyinaa.",
        "reference": "Tito 3:15",
